; cluster for all dynamic quantities: motion described with cause (force).
; dynamics asks WHY — what force causes this motion?
; Newton's laws are the niyama of this cluster.
; units: force is kg⋅m⋅s⁻² (newton); torque is kg⋅m²⋅s⁻²
; sangati roots

(kosha dynamics-varga
  (vishesa physics-varga)
  (swarupa subanta)
  (matra newton kilogram metre second)
  (yukta mula-shakti gati niyama kaala))
